    "description": {
      "value": "This ornate spyglass has a brass tube inscribed with constellations and green-tinted lens. It's often used by field astronomers to pick out greater details among stars and other celestial bodies. Like a typical spyglass, you can see eight times farther while looking through a _stargazer's spyglass_.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Traits:** envision\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Requirements:** You are viewing the night sky with the spyglass.\n\nYou set your eye upon a star and think of someone to cast guiding star."
